WEBVTT

00:07:59.391 --> 00:08:01.810
2.6 million dollars.

00:08:03.854 --> 00:08:06.023
Would you like to hear
some more good news?

00:08:06.023 --> 00:08:07.316
Audience: Yes!

00:08:07.316 --> 00:08:08.609
RC: Aside from forests --

00:08:08.609 --> 00:08:11.487
because we are land people,
we just think of forests --

00:08:11.487 --> 00:08:14.031
go a little bit into the water.

00:08:14.031 --> 00:08:19.370
Seagrass, saltmarsh mangroves,
kelp forests, peatlands, wetlands --

00:08:19.411 --> 00:08:23.082
these are living systems
that suck in so much carbon dioxide

00:08:23.123 --> 00:08:25.042
beyond your imagination,

00:08:25.084 --> 00:08:27.461
and they keep it forever in their roots

00:08:27.503 --> 00:08:30.130
as long as you leave them alone
and you look after them.